		(libpart
			(lib "Morse_Local")
			(part "OSL40562-IR")
			(description "0.56in x4 digit dynamic-connection 7-segment LED display, common anode, red (Akizuki 103672). Pin mapping decoded geometrically from the datasheet pin-function diagram (junction dots all sit on same-letter columns; external segment pins lie under the DIG.2 columns): A=11 B=7 C=4 D=2 E=1 F=10 G=5 DP=3; digit COM: DIG.1=12 DIG.2=9 DIG.3=8 DIG.4=6. Confirm by lighting each TM1637 SEG line in the bring-up test (step 3). See hardware/morse_code/morse_code_design_notes.md sec.3-2 and datasheet/OSL40562-IR_segment_pin_decode.png.")
			(docs "https://akizukidenshi.com/goodsaffix/OSL40562-IR.pdf")
			(fields
